*.md
!/README.md
!/readme/*.md
!/SIGNING-POLICY.md
!.github/release_template.md
!.github/release_template_pre.md
# 鸿蒙移植版的发行说明模板（发布流程见 docs/release_process_ohos.md）
!.github/release_template_ohos.md
